{"slug":"f-w-z","ar":"ف و ز","total":29,"core":"success; triumph","forms":[{"ar":"فَوْز","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":19,"gloss":"success, triumph","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":60,"p":4,"ar":["إِنَّ","هَـٰذَا","لَهُوَ","ٱلْفَوْزُ","ٱلْعَظِيمُ"],"en":"Indeed, this is the great attainment"}},{"ar":"فَآئِزُون","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"successful","word":null,"ex":{"s":23,"a":111,"p":8,"ar":["إِنِّى","جَزَيْتُهُمُ","ٱلْيَوْمَ","بِمَا","صَبَرُوٓا۟","أَنَّهُمْ","هُمُ","ٱلْفَآئِزُونَ"],"en":"Indeed, I have rewarded them this Day for their patient endurance - that they are the attainers [of success]"}},{"ar":"فَازَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":3,"gloss":"to succeed, attain","word":null,"ex":{"s":33,"a":71,"p":12,"ar":["يُصْلِحْ","لَكُمْ","أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","وَيَغْفِرْ","لَكُمْ","ذُنُوبَكُمْ ۗ","وَمَن","يُطِعِ","ٱللَّهَ","وَرَسُولَهُۥ","فَقَدْ","فَازَ","فَوْزًا","عَظِيمًا"],"en":"He will [then] amend for you your deeds and forgive you your sins. And whoever obeys Allah and His Messenger has certainly attained a great attainment"}},{"ar":"مَفَازَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"salvation, escape","word":null,"ex":{"s":39,"a":61,"p":5,"ar":["وَيُنَجِّى","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ٱتَّقَوْا۟","بِمَفَازَتِهِمْ","لَا","يَمَسُّهُمُ","ٱلسُّوٓءُ","وَلَا","هُمْ","يَحْزَنُونَ"],"en":"And Allah will save those who feared Him by their attainment; no evil will touch them, nor will they grieve"}},{"ar":"مَفَاز","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"success","word":null,"ex":{"s":78,"a":31,"p":3,"ar":["إِنَّ","لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","مَفَازًا"],"en":"Indeed, for the righteous is attainment"}}],"surahs":[[9,5],[4,3],[3,2],[33,2],[5,1],[6,1],[10,1],[23,1],[24,1],[37,1],[39,1],[40,1],[44,1],[45,1],[48,1],[57,1],[59,1],[61,1],[64,1],[78,1],[85,1]]}